@startuml order-to-cash-draft
' The same process as a first draft, before the conventions gate: noun-phrase
' functions, lanes that ignore the naming convention, an unlabelled XOR
' outcome, no end event, and no ownership or process-ID tag. Grammar-valid:
' PlantUML renders it without complaint — that is the gap the gate closes.
title Order to cash — first draft

|Sales|
start
:Order intake;
:Order validation;
if (Valid?) then (yes)
  |credit control|
  :Credit check;
  |Warehouse & Logistics|
  :Pick goods;
  :Ship goods;
  |FIN|
  :Create invoice;
  :Send invoice;
  :Record payment;
else
  |Sales|
  :Reject order;
endif
@enduml
